### GraphQL Product Query

```graphql
query GetProducts($first: Int!) {
  products(first: $first) {
    edges {
      node {
        id
        title
        handle
        variants(first: 5) {
          edges {
            node {
              id
              price
              inventoryQuantity
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
    pageInfo {
      hasNextPage
      endCursor
    }
  }
}
```

